<p><a name="fn12"></a>12. Financial Stability Oversight Council, <a href="https://home.treasury.gov/system/files/261/FSOC2022AnnualReport.pdf"><em>2022 Annual Report </em>(PDF)</a> (Washington: Financial Stability Oversight Council, 2022): 44. <a href="#f12">Return to text</a></p>

<p><a name="fn13"></a>13. <a href="https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2023-09-18/pdf/2023-19200.pdf">Regulatory Capital Rule: Large Banking Organizations and Banking Organizations with Significant Trading Activity (PDF)</a>, 88 Fed. Reg. 64,028 (September 18, 2023). See questions 54 and 55. <a href="#f13">Return to text</a></p>

